    "sealWords": "up to 7 characters, combined with list seals up to 3; today's-word forbidden lines and no sexual words; stored as word:<text> on events and receipts",
    "extension": "payer extend_request 1/3/7/14/30 days, one at a time, extend_withdraw; manager extend_accept extends from the current end, extend_decline; no entry fee"
